  "title": "Selection spends the top layer",
  "subject": "Whether global failures of laws that compose like cycles can keep a knot inside their selected spaces, and what can survive",
  "conclusion": "Global failures over Z_(p^k) with k at least 2 keep knots: signed Z4 does after every removal on a 6-point 4-regular substrate, and on a 9-point cubic substrate, the minimum at three places. Over any finite chain ring a global failure leaves, after any removal, solutions whose top layer is one line, so a kept knot has at most one full-range variable and hides at most k - 1 digits.",
